{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想養成穩定的飲水習慣，又不想被帳號註冊與廣告打擾，這款補水紀錄工具正好合用。《Water Tracker for Dummies》適合需要在 iPhone 與 iPad 上記錄每日飲水量、查看每週紀錄與長期趨勢的使用者，全程離線運作，紀錄只保留在裝置之上。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75.webp\">\n<h2>自訂水樽帳本記錄每次補水</h2>\n<p>點選飲品容量、自訂份量或從目錄挑選飲品，也可在 Bottle Bench 為常用水樽命名並一鍵補充，今日總量、目標進度與每週紀錄即時更新。1.6 版新增的 Bottle Bench 屬隨身水樽帳本，可為實際使用的容器設定容量與刻度。程式另備補水節奏提示、配速教練、補登過去日期與裝置端提醒，全程離線運作，無帳號、無廣告、無雲端同步。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-263-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-264-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-265-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-266-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-267-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Water Tracker for Dummies</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.991867+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":395,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T21:20:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T18:57:48.205771+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:15.731633+00:00","content_hash":"0042ecad4df466209f42b824fa70719102ffef0e2fc6e0ebc03782011db20982","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}